	(descr "2x15, 1.27mm pitch SMD micro header, modeled on Samtec FTSH-115-0x-x-DV (FTSH SMT Micro Header catalog, suddendocs.samtec.com/catalog_english/ftsh_mt.pdf, F-226; 1.27mm/.050in pitch, dual-row vertical, 15 positions/row) cross-checked against KiCad's maintained stock PinHeader_2x15_P1.27mm_Vertical_SMD footprint (pad 2.4x0.74mm, 3.9mm row pitch) since Samtec's catalog page gives mechanical/plating options but not numeric SMT land-pattern dimensions. Pin numbering: odd=row A (x<0), even=row B (x>0), matches INTERFACE.md 'RF Board To ADC Board' contract (odd pins row A / even pins row B). Used for RF-board-to-ADC-board interconnect per hardware/24ghz-adf590x-fmcw-rev-c/INTERFACE.md.")
